SAY   epochs over the 3.3 billion word corpus. We use Adam with learning rate of 1e-4, β1 = 0.9, β2 = 0.999, L2 weight decay of 0.01, learning rate warmup over the first 10,000 steps, and linear decay of the learning rate. We use a dropout probability of 0.1 on all layers. We use a gelu activation (Hendrycks and Gimpel, 2016) rather than the standard relu, following OpenAI GPT. The training loss is the sum of the mean masked LM likelihood and the mean next sentence prediction likelihood.
PAUSE 500
SAY   Next Sentence Prediction The next sentence prediction task can be illustrated in the following examples.
PAUSE 500
SAY   Input = [CLS] the man went to [MASK] store [SEP]
PAUSE 500
SAY   he bought a gallon [MASK] milk [SEP]
PAUSE 500
SAY   Training of BERTBASE was performed on 4 Cloud TPUs in Pod configuration (16 TPU chips total).13 Training of BERTLARGE was performed on 16 Cloud TPUs (64 TPU chips total). Each pre-training took 4 days to complete.
PAUSE 500
SAY   Label = IsNext
